@startuml
!theme cyborg
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam defaultFontColor #F3F4F6
title Proposed — Upload with conditional resumable transport
skinparam backgroundColor #111827
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Arial

actor Owner
participant Files as F
database "Quota / attempt ledger" as D
participant "Private storage adapter" as S
Owner -> F : exact upload intent / declared bounds
F -> D : guarded current authority, policy and growth reservation
alt actual transport supports chunked / resumable upload
 loop each eligible bounded chunk
  Owner -> F : same upload identity + validated chunk identity / position
  F -> S : write private bounded candidate; verify duplicate / overlap semantics
  S --> F : actual stored / failed / uncertain evidence
 end
else selected simple upload
 Owner -> F : bounded content for same intent
 F -> S : write private candidate
end
F -> S : validate actual content / completeness / usable identity
S --> F : actual evidence
F -> D : reconcile reservation + confirmed usage; mark usable only when supported
F --> Owner : confirmed / pending / rejected / unknown

@enduml